WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.001 --> 00:00:02.452
The window washer fell.

2
00:00:02.453 --> 00:00:05.494
Zoom! Roxy flew down and caught him.

3
00:00:05.495 --> 00:00:09.061
The man hugged Roxy. "Thank you!"

4
00:00:09.062 --> 00:00:13.496
"No problem!" Roxy placed the man on the sidewalk.

5
00:00:13.497 --> 00:00:19.729
She started to look for Flash, but just then her watch beeped.

6
00:00:19.730 --> 00:00:23.766
"Mayor Bloom," Roxy said. "What's wrong?"

7
00:00:23.767 --> 00:00:27.918
"Someone robbed Greenstar Grocery!" Mayor Bloom said.

8
00:00:27.919 --> 00:00:33.194
"I'm on my way!"

9
00:00:33.195 --> 00:00:36.995
Roxy flew toward Greenstar Grocery.

10
00:00:36.996 --> 00:00:41.538
Her watch beeped again.

11
00:00:41.539 --> 00:00:43.302
"Mayor Bloom?"

12
00:00:43.303 --> 00:00:45.867
"There was another robbery," the mayor said.

13
00:00:45.868 --> 00:00:48.713
"It was at Midtown Shoes."

14
00:00:48.714 --> 00:00:51.630
Roxy turned around.

15
00:00:51.631 --> 00:00:56.475
Mayor Bloom called again.

16
00:00:56.476 --> 00:00:58.928
"Forget about Midtown Shoes, Rocket Girl.

17
00:00:58.929 --> 00:01:02.288
The thief just robbed West Slope Gallery."

18
00:01:02.289 --> 00:01:05.511
"Flick is fast!" Roxy thought.

19
00:01:05.512 --> 00:01:07.740
The phone on Mayor Bloom's desk rang.

20
00:01:07.741 --> 00:01:12.003
"Hello? Oh, that's terrible!"

21
00:01:12.004 --> 00:01:15.144
"What happened now, Mayor?" Roxy asked.

22
00:01:15.145 --> 00:01:18.366
"Three restaurants were robbed," Mayor Bloom said.

23
00:01:18.367 --> 00:01:21.291
"A sporting goods store was robbed too."

24
00:01:21.292 --> 00:01:26.778
Roxy sighed. "Don't worry, Mayor. I'll catch the thief."

25
00:01:26.779 --> 00:01:32.734
Roxy closed her watch and landed on a building.

26
00:01:32.735 --> 00:01:34.694
"How will I catch Flick?"

27
00:01:34.695 --> 00:01:38.741
Roxy tapped her chin. "I know!"

28
00:01:38.742 --> 00:01:43.734
Roxy flew up high. She could see the entire city.

29
00:01:43.735 --> 00:01:47.179
"I'll wait until I see Flick," Roxy thought.

30
00:01:47.180 --> 00:01:50.358
"Then I'll zoom down and catch her."

31
00:01:50.359 --> 00:01:51.906
Roxy waited.

32
00:01:51.907 --> 00:01:55.733
Finally she saw Flick zooming across Metro City Park.

33
00:01:55.734 --> 00:01:58.148
Roxy shot after her.

34
00:01:58.149 --> 00:02:03.729
"You can't catch me, Rocket Girl!" Flick ran faster.

35
00:02:03.730 --> 00:02:06.476
"Flick is quick!" Roxy thought.

36
00:02:06.477 --> 00:02:09.401
Flick shot past the 5K runners.

37
00:02:09.402 --> 00:02:11.522
Terrell and Jack were walking.

38
00:02:11.523 --> 00:02:15.308
Fwoosh! The wind from Flick knocked them over.

39
00:02:15.309 --> 00:02:20.243
Jack looked around. "Did something just fly past us?"

40
00:02:20.244 --> 00:02:23.208
Mara felt a gust of wind.

41
00:02:23.209 --> 00:02:25.609
Then she heard someone rushing up behind her.

42
00:02:25.610 --> 00:02:29.089
She gasped. "Rocket Girl!"

43
00:02:29.090 --> 00:02:32.619
Fwoosh! Flick zipped past the finish line.

44
00:02:32.620 --> 00:02:34.164
No one saw her though.

45
00:02:34.165 --> 00:02:35.796
She was too fast.

46
00:02:35.797 --> 00:02:37.850
Roxy shot by next.

47
00:02:37.851 --> 00:02:41.287
"Rocket Girl wins!" a man said.

48
00:02:41.288 --> 00:02:44.659
Roxy wasn't paying attention to him.

49
00:02:44.660 --> 00:02:47.251
She saw Flick running toward the lake.

50
00:02:47.252 --> 00:02:49.685
Roxy's eyes went wide.

51
00:02:49.686 --> 00:02:52.743
Flick ran across the water's surface!

52
00:02:52.744 --> 00:02:55.316
"Freeze breath!" Roxy thought.

53
00:02:55.317 --> 00:02:58.429
She blew. Whoo-ooo-oosh!

54
00:02:58.430 --> 00:03:00.467
The lake froze.

55
00:03:00.468 --> 00:03:04.959
Flick's feet stuck to the ice.

56
00:03:04.960 --> 00:03:09.778
"Ha!" Roxy said. "I caught you, Flick!"

57
00:03:09.779 --> 00:03:14.776
Flick tried to lift her feet, but they were stuck. "Gah!"

58
00:03:14.777 --> 00:03:16.299
Roxy grabbed her.

59
00:03:16.300 --> 00:03:26.836
Then she melted the ice and brought Flick to jail.

60
00:03:26.837 --> 00:03:28.477
Roxy returned to the park.

61
00:03:28.478 --> 00:03:33.960
The crowd cheered as she crossed the finish line last.

62
00:03:33.961 --> 00:03:36.625
"Good run, Roxy!" Jack said.

63
00:03:36.626 --> 00:03:40.765
"Thanks," Roxy said. "I guess I lost."

64
00:03:40.766 --> 00:03:44.271
"Yeah, but guess who won," Mara said.

65
00:03:44.272 --> 00:03:46.407
"Who?" Roxy asked.

66
00:03:46.408 --> 00:03:50.848
Terrell grinned. "Rocket Girl!"

